* Albert the Bear ({{Langx|de|Albrecht der Bär|links=no}})
* ''All Quiet on the Western Front'' ({{Langx|de|Im Westen nichts Neues|lit=In the West Nothing New}}) is a novel by [[Erich Maria Remarque]].
